    "reading": {
        "body": "Palantir's listed product is Palantir AIP, categorized under data & analytics ai, with enterprise AI platform as the function this data names first.\n\nThe data also tags Palantir AIP with defense/intel focus and high-stakes decision influence, description of what the product does rather than how well it does it. Beyond that, the entry flags ontology-based governance, governance and dependency notes rather than technical specifications.\n\nPalantir sits at the application layer here, a product built on top of underlying compute rather than a claim on the compute itself, so this entry does not speak to the buildings or power behind it. Beyond the category, the product name, and this short list of tags tied to palantir.com, the data carries no user counts, revenue, funding, or headcount, so nothing here supports a claim about Palantir's scale or trajectory.",
